   173→/**
   174→ * Calculate crop yield from temperature anomaly
   175→ * 
   176→ * Research: Each 1°C drop reduces crop yield by 5-10%
   177→ * At -15°C, crops fail almost entirely (90% reduction)
   178→ * 
   179→ * @param tempAnomaly - Temperature drop (negative °C)
